<title>FRANCE: French parliamentary election narrowing - CSA.</title>
<headline>French parliamentary election narrowing - CSA.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the results of an opinion poll of voters' intentions ahead of the May 25/June 1 parlimentary election.</p>
<p>The telephone poll of 1,008 registered voters was conducted by CSA on May 15 and 16 for the French dailyu Le Parisien and made public on May 16:</p>
<p>			   percentage  projected seats in</p>
<p>			    of vote    National Assembly</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Extreme left		3		 0</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Communists		 10.5	    23</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Socialists-other left  27	     233</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Ecologists		  7.5	     0</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------</p>
<p> RPR/UDF-other right    38	     299</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------</p>
<p> National Front	   14		 0</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5339</p>
